	affiliations = {Uttaranchal Institute of Technology, Uttaranchal University, Uttarakhand, India; Christ (Deemed to Be) University, Doctoral Scholar School of Business and Management, Karnataka, Bangalore, India; Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj University, Department of Computer Science & Information Technology, Navi Mumbai, India; Universidad TecnolΓ³gica Del PerΓΊ, Department of Business, Peru; Savitribai Phule Pune University, JSPM'S JSCOE-MCA Department, Maharashtra, Pune, India; Graphic Era Deemed to Be University, Department of Computer, Science & Engineering, Uttarakhand, Dehradun, India},
